        dcterms:description "Deterministic RNG (`seed=2009`), 8-check `--self-test` suite (L681-720) verifying SHA-256 locks, JSON parity, Lean Theorems 1-3, 2D PDE anti-phase stripe formation, laser-ablation survival collapse and polarity regeneration, dual negative controls, specimen segmentation, and bitwise two-run determinism, plus self-contained 8-panel PNG and 6-frame animated GIF outputs." ;
